  "practice": [
    "Say এ three times and notice that its sound can range from e to ay depending on the word: e, e, e.",
    "Read each vocabulary word aloud and listen for এ at the beginning or ে after a consonant.",
    "Practice the vowel sign: ক + ে = কে, ম + ে = মে, and দ + ে = দে.",
    "Remember that ে is written visually to the left of its consonant but pronounced after it."
  ],
  "notes": [
    "এ is generally pronounced e, roughly like the e in bed or ay depending on the word.",
    "When এ is attached to a consonant, it usually appears as the ে vowel sign (এ-কার).",
    "Like ি, the ে sign is written visually to the left of the consonant but pronounced after it: কে is ke.",
    "The repeated source entry দেখে has been combined into one vocabulary item with all supplied meanings."
  ]
